styk-auto/1
# The stage widget's automated interaction (N2): a repository fixture, a stage as large as its canvas, the view panned and
# zoomed away and brought back exactly (every number is a power of two or a half), so the last frame is the document
# exported at that view. Local alias only; the runner binds `fixture` to engine/tests/edit/startup.document.json.
open fixture
frame 0
pan 120 -60
zoom 2 300 200
pan -33 17
zoom 0.5 300 200
pan -103.5 51.5
frame 0
